1
00:00:00,667 --> 00:00:02,125
Let's make a promise to
each other,

2
00:00:02,375 --> 00:00:04,500
to always be together.

3
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,292
A special heavy rain advisory
has just been issued

4
00:00:13,417 --> 00:00:15,167
in the Tokyo area.

5
00:00:16,792 --> 00:00:18,792
Would you like the rain to stop?

6
00:00:18,875 --> 00:00:21,208
- What do you mean by–
- It's gonna clear up.

7
00:00:30,417 --> 00:00:33,333
She really was the sunshine girl.

8
00:00:41,917 --> 00:00:43,917
What do you know about the boy
in the video?

9
00:00:44,667 --> 00:00:45,417
Stop!

10
00:00:45,458 --> 00:00:47,875
What do I do? They're
going to separate us!

11
00:00:48,167 --> 00:00:49,083
Let's run away!

12
00:00:55,208 --> 00:00:56,417
One must be careful.

13
00:00:57,292 --> 00:01:00,167
A tragic fate awaits
the weather maiden.

14
00:01:00,542 --> 00:01:02,208
Let's make a promise to
each other,

15
00:01:02,292 --> 00:01:04,000
to always be together.

16
00:01:04,750 --> 00:01:07,750
There's nothing more gorgeous
than a beautiful clear sky.

17
00:01:08,125 --> 00:01:09,208
Hold on tight!

18
00:01:11,042 --> 00:01:12,500
I don't want to shoot you!

19
00:01:20,917 --> 00:01:22,083
Hina!

20
00:01:23,125 --> 00:01:25,917
You helped me find
a reason to live.

21
00:01:26,042 --> 00:01:27,583
I'm really glad I met you.

22
00:01:27,792 --> 00:01:30,333
So please don't cry, Hodaka.

23
00:01:32,333 --> 00:01:33,958
Time to grow up, little man.

24
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:35,833
I need to see her again!

25
00:01:36,250 --> 00:01:37,667
Even if it's just once!

26
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:41,917
Hina?

27
00:01:44,125 --> 00:01:45,333
Where are you?

